# Gaming & Esports

Verify players, re-engage lapsed users, and notify communities at scale.

Gaming platforms live and die by player verification, re-engagement, and community trust. We provide the OTP infrastructure to onboard players securely, plus the messaging tools to bring lapsed players back and keep esports communities informed of tournaments and updates.

