FAQs:

Q: Can this reduce bot and fraudulent signups?
A: OTP verification at signup significantly raises the cost of automated fake account creation, though it should be paired with other fraud signals for full protection.

Q: Does this work for global player bases?
A: Yes, our carrier network supports OTP and messaging delivery across a wide range of countries and mobile operators.